---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AffiliateDisclosure from '../components/AffiliateDisclosure.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Start here" description="How to use StackPick Lab to choose AI writing and SEO tools." moneyPage>
  <AffiliateDisclosure compact />
  <h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Start here</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-slate-600">
    A short path through the site if you’re choosing tools under budget pressure.
  </p>
  <ol class="prose-spl mt-8 list-decimal space-y-4 pl-6">
    <li>
      <strong>Name the job.</strong> Research keywords, draft posts, or optimize finished drafts?
      Different jobs → different tools.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Read one comparison.</strong> Try
      <a href="/compare/semrush-vs-surfer-seo">Semrush vs Surfer</a> if you’re unsure whether you need both,
      or <a href="/compare/frase-vs-surfer">Frase vs Surfer</a> if you’re picking a content optimizer.
      If the question is simply “is Surfer worth the seat?”, start with
      <a href="/blog/is-surfer-seo-worth-it-2026">Is Surfer SEO worth it in 2026?</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Check Best for / Skip if.</strong> If you match “Skip if,” walk away—even if the affiliate link is tempting.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Prefer one good seat.</strong> Most solopreneurs overbuy. Add a second tool only when a clear workflow gap remains.
      Budget-constrained teams can start with
      <a href="/blog/best-ai-writing-tools-under-100">under-$100 AI writing picks</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Map the pipeline.</strong> Use the
      <a href="/blog/ai-content-ops-stack-research-draft-optimize">Research → Draft → Optimize stack guide</a>
      before buying overlapping seats. Solo bloggers choosing research tools can compare
      <a href="/compare/semrush-vs-ahrefs-vs-free">Semrush vs Ahrefs vs free</a>; ChatGPT/Claude users can check
      <a href="/blog/jasper-alternatives-chatgpt-claude">Jasper alternatives</a>.
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <a href="/compare/jasper-vs-copyai-vs-writesonic" class="btn-primary">AI writers comparison</a>
    <a href="/compare/ai-writing-tools-under-100" class="btn-secondary">Under $100 picks</a>
    <a href="/compare/semrush-vs-ahrefs-vs-free" class="btn-secondary">Solo SEO tools</a>
    <a href="/newsletter" class="btn-secondary">Get new picks by email</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
